      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "# Hyperparameter Exploration\n\nA **Grid Search Train** scan: the JSON `param_grid` is expanded into every combination of hidden widths x learning rate, each one trains a **fresh** network with the Training Loop machinery (early stop, best-snapshot rollback), and every combination lands in the runs ledger.\n\nPress **Queue** once - the scan runs inside this single execution and the winner's parameters come out of `params`. Open the **CDL App Panel** while it runs: the combination curves overlay live in the comparison chart, and the experiment stays browsable in **Experiment runs** afterwards (the winner is marked `*`). Change `direction` to `max` to sweep a metric where bigger is better."
      ],
      "title": "How this works"
    },
